    <unit id="AutoSetFontSizeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>For letter type Avatar, when the letters are too long to display, the font size can be automatically adjusted according to the width of the Avatar. You can also use gap to set the unit distance between left and right sides.</source>
        <target state="translated">對於字母類型頭像，當字母過長無法展示時，字號會根據頭像寬度自動調整。也可以使用 gap 設置左右兩側的單位距離。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
